  Description: In your youth, you earned coin running messages for persons of wealth
    and influence, darting through crowded city streets. Your dogged commitment to
    deliver your message was good training for the life of an adventurer. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence , and one is a
    free attribute boost. You're trained in the Society skill and the Lore skill
    for the city in which you were raised. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Glean
    Contents] skill feat.
